1748/LR&DMD/GOS/ ACQ/317-318 dated 12-08-2017;
(ii) Letter bearing No.1748/LR&DMD/ACQ/GOS/418 dated 20-09-2017; and WP(C) No.32 of 2018 : Karma Tshering Bhutia vs. State of Sikkim and Others 28 and WP(C) No.43 of 2022 : College of Agriculture Engineering and Post Harvest Technology vs. State of Sikkim and Others (iii) Letter bearing No.1748/LR&DMD/2018/631 dated "NIL" 2018, all stand quashed.
